---

<DocsLayout
  title="Lunixia"
  description="Journal, understand your moods, track your health, keep notes, explore spiritual tools, and build a deeper picture of your wellbeing with Lunixia."
>
  <main class="lunixia-page">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-copy reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">Meet Lunixia</p>

        <h1>Understand your inner world, care for your health, and keep what matters close.</h1>

        <p class="hero-text">
          Lunixia is a personal wellbeing companion built around the different
          parts of you that shape each day. Journal and uncover themes, understand
          your moods, track medications and symptoms, follow health patterns,
          capture notes, explore spiritual tools, and keep your self-care
          connected in one deeply personal space.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions" aria-label="Lunixia links">
          <a class="primary-button raised-button" href="#features">
            Explore Features
          </a>

          <a class="secondary-button raised-button" href="/contact">
            Contact Support
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-showcase reveal reveal-delay">
        <div class="showcase-card main-card">
          <span class="mini-label">Your World in Lunixia</span>

          <h4>See yourself with more context.</h4>

          <div class="progress-line">
            <span></span>
          </div>

          <div class="showcase-stats">
            <span><b>Journal</b> reflections</span>
            <span><b>Mood</b> insights</span>
            <span><b>Health</b> patterns</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="floating-card floating-card-one">
          <span>Journal Insight</span>
          <strong>Your patterns are taking shape</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="floating-card floating-card-two">
          <span>Wellbeing</span>
          <strong>Your day has more context</strong>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <GradientDivider />

    <section class="intro-section reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">One Connected Picture</p>

      <h2>Your thoughts, emotions, health, and self-care do not exist separately.</h2>

      <p>
        Lunixia brings journaling, mood, health, notes, spiritual reflection, and
        self-care into one personal system. Instead of looking at each part of
        yourself in isolation, you can keep the context around your days together
        and understand how those pieces change over time.
      </p>
    </section>

