    <section
      class="feature-grid"
      id="features"
      aria-label="Lunixia features"
    >
      <article class="feature-card wide reveal">
        <p class="card-kicker">Journal</p>

        <h3>Give your thoughts somewhere to become more than a passing moment</h3>

        <p>
          Build journal books, write entries, set a daily intention, follow your
          journaling streak, and use Lunixia's analysis tools to look deeper into
          what you have written. Theme Insights can surface recurring themes across
          an entire journal book so individual entries can become part of a larger
          picture.
        </p>

        <div class="chip-row">
          <span>Journal Books</span>
          <span>AI Analysis</span>
          <span>Theme Insights</span>
          <span>Daily Intention</span>
          <span>Streaks</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-card reveal">
        <p class="card-kicker">Mood</p>

        <h3>Log how you feel and look beyond a single check-in</h3>

        <p>
          Record your mood and use Lunixia's mood analysis to add context to what
          you are feeling. Your emotional state becomes part of the same personal
          picture as your journal and health information.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-card reveal">
        <p class="card-kicker">Medications</p>

        <h3>Keep medication information and refill awareness close</h3>

        <p>
          Lunixia includes a medication manager with medication tracking,
          automatic decrement behavior, and refill notifications so medication
          information can live alongside the rest of your health experience.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-card reveal">
        <p class="card-kicker">Symptoms</p>

        <h3>Keep track of what your body is telling you</h3>

        <p>
          Use the symptom tracker to record symptoms and keep their history
          available as part of Lunixia's broader health experience instead of
          relying on memory alone.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-card reveal">
        <p class="card-kicker">Notes</p>

        <h3>Capture the things you want to keep outside your journal</h3>

        <p>
          Lunixia includes a dedicated notes experience with flexible note tools,
          checklist support, and font choices so useful information has somewhere
          to live without becoming part of a journal entry.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-card wide reveal">
        <p class="card-kicker">Health</p>

        <h3>See more of your physical wellbeing in one place</h3>

        <p>
          The Health page brings medications, symptoms, body and emotional state,
          sleep, vitals, exercise, water, and steps into one connected view.
          Lunixia uses HealthKit where supported to bring relevant health context
          into the experience while preserving dedicated histories for the things
          you log and track.
        </p>

        <div class="reader-preview">
          <div class="reader-preview-top">
            <span>Today's Wellbeing</span>
            <strong>Connected</strong>
          </div>

          <div class="reader-bar">
            <span></span>
          </div>

          <div class="reader-meta">
            <span>Vitals</span>
            <span>Sleep</span>
            <span>Movement</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="spotlight reveal">
      <div class="spotlight-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Journal Intelligence</p>

        <h2>Look across your reflections instead of reading them one at a time</h2>

        <p>
          Lunixia's journal tools are built for both reflection and perspective.
          Journal analysis can help you examine an individual entry, while Theme
          Insights can look across the tags and entries in a journal book to help
          recurring ideas and patterns become easier to see.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="share-demo" aria-label="Lunixia journal insight preview">
        <span class="share-pill">Theme Insights</span>

        <h4>Notice what keeps returning.</h4>

        <div class="share-row">
          <span>Entries</span>
          <strong>Reflect on individual writing</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="share-row">
          <span>Tags</span>
          <strong>Connect recurring themes</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="share-row">
          <span>Insights</span>
          <strong>See the larger pattern</strong>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="details-section reveal">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Everything Else</p>

        <h2>Open each part of the Lunixia experience</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="details-list">
        <details open>
          <summary>
            <span>
              <b>Journal Books & Entries</b>
              <small>Build separate spaces for different parts of your reflection</small>
            </span>
          </summary>

          <p>
            Create journal books, write entries inside them, pin the books you want
            close, and keep your writing organized without flattening every
            reflection into one endless journal.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details>
          <summary>
            <span>
              <b>Daily Intention & Journal Streaks</b>
              <small>Give reflection a place in the rhythm of your day</small>
            </span>
          </summary>

          <p>
            Set a daily intention and follow your current and best journaling streaks.
            Lunixia keeps those pieces near the journal itself so reflection can
            become something you return to over time.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details>
          <summary>
            <span>
              <b>Body & Emotional State</b>
              <small>See a simple read on how your system may be doing today</small>
            </span>
          </summary>

          <p>
            The Health page includes body and emotional state cards informed by
            available health context, giving you another way to view the day
            alongside the health information you are already tracking.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details>
          <summary>
            <span>
              <b>Sleep, Vitals & Exercise</b>
              <small>Keep everyday health information visible and reviewable</small>
            </span>
          </summary>

          <p>
            Review sleep information, log and revisit vitals, and record exercise
            from the Health page. Lunixia keeps these health areas together so
            you can look at them in the context of the same day.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details>
          <summary>
            <span>
              <b>Water & Steps</b>
              <small>Follow everyday movement and hydration over time</small>
            </span>
          </summary>

          <p>
            Track water throughout the day, review water history, follow your step
            count, and view progress toward the goals you have set for those
            everyday health metrics.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details>
          <summary>
            <span>
              <b>Notes & Checklists</b>
              <small>Keep useful information separate from reflective writing</small>
            </span>
          </summary>

          <p>
            Use Lunixia's notes space for information you want to keep, format,
            and revisit outside the journal. Checklist tools and note appearance
            controls give that space more flexibility.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details>
          <summary>
            <span>
              <b>Spiritual Space</b>
              <small>Keep reflection and spiritual exploration within the same app</small>
            </span>
          </summary>

          <p>
            Lunixia includes a dedicated Spiritual area alongside Journal, Mood,
            Health, and Notes, giving spiritual reflection its own place without
            separating it from the rest of your personal wellbeing experience.
          </p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="community-banner reveal">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Built Around the Whole You</p>

        <h2>Wellbeing makes more sense when you can see the context around it.</h2>

        <p>
          Lunixia is built around the idea that your thoughts, moods, physical
          health, self-care, notes, and spiritual life can influence one another.
          Each gets its own space while remaining part of one connected experience
          designed to help you understand your days with more context.
        </p>
      </div>

      <a class="primary-button raised-button" href="https://discord.gg/SaZJKF3d9U">
        Join the Community
      </a>
    </section>

    <section class="cta-section reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">Explore Lunixia</p>

      <h2>Keep more of your inner and everyday life connected.</h2>

      <p>
        Learn more about Lunixia, report a problem, share an idea, or reach out
        directly through Voxiverse Support.
      </p>

      <div class="cta-grid">
        <a
          href="https://github.com/asteriasmoons/Lunixia/issues/1"
          class="cta-card"
        >
          <span class="cta-kicker">Report an Issue</span>

          <h2>Lunixia Bug Reports</h2>

          <span class="cta-button">Open Reports</span>
        </a>

        <a href="/github" class="cta-card">
          <span class="cta-kicker">Ideas & Discussions</span>

          <h2>Voxiverse on GitHub</h2>

          <span class="cta-button">Open GitHub</span>
        </a>

        <a href="/contact" class="cta-card">
          <span class="cta-kicker">Need Help?</span>

          <h2>Contact Support</h2>

          <span class="cta-button">Get Support</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</DocsLayout>

<script>
  const revealItems = document.querySelectorAll(".reveal");

  const revealObserver = new IntersectionObserver(
    (entries) => {
      entries.forEach((entry) => {
        if (entry.isIntersecting) {
          entry.target.classList.add("is-visible");
          revealObserver.unobserve(entry.target);
        }
      });
    },
    { threshold: 0.12 }
  );

  revealItems.forEach((item) => revealObserver.observe(item));

  document
    .querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>("[data-lunixia-gallery]")
    .forEach((gallery) => {
      const track =
        gallery.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-gallery-track]");

      const slides = Array.from(
        gallery.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>(".gallery-slide")
      );

      const previousButton =
        gallery.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>(
          "[data-gallery-previous]"
        );

      const nextButton =
        gallery.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>(
          "[data-gallery-next]"
        );

      const count =
        gallery.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-gallery-count]");

      const progress =
        gallery.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-gallery-progress]");

      if (
        !track ||
        !slides.length ||
        !previousButton ||
        !nextButton
      ) {
        return;
      }

      let currentIndex = 0;
      let autoplay: number | undefined;
      let dragStartX = 0;

      const updateGallery = () => {
        track.style.transform =
          `translateX(-${currentIndex * 100}%)`;

        slides.forEach((slide, index) => {
          slide.classList.toggle(
            "is-active",
            index === currentIndex
          );
        });

        if (count) {
          count.textContent =
            `${currentIndex + 1} / ${slides.length}`;
        }

        if (progress) {
          progress.style.width =
            `${((currentIndex + 1) / slides.length) * 100}%`;
        }
      };

      const showSlide = (index: number) => {
        currentIndex =
          (index + slides.length) % slides.length;

        updateGallery();
      };

      const startAutoplay = () => {
        window.clearInterval(autoplay);

        autoplay = window.setInterval(
          () => showSlide(currentIndex + 1),
          4200
        );
      };

      const stopAutoplay = () => {
        window.clearInterval(autoplay);
      };

      nextButton.addEventListener("click", () => {
        showSlide(currentIndex + 1);
        startAutoplay();
      });

      previousButton.addEventListener("click", () => {
        showSlide(currentIndex - 1);
        startAutoplay();
      });

      gallery.addEventListener("pointerdown", (event) => {
        dragStartX = event.clientX;
        stopAutoplay();
      });

      gallery.addEventListener("pointerup", (event) => {
        const deltaX = event.clientX - dragStartX;

        if (Math.abs(deltaX) > 40) {
          showSlide(
            currentIndex + (deltaX < 0 ? 1 : -1)
          );
        }

        startAutoplay();
      });

      gallery.addEventListener(
        "mouseenter",
        stopAutoplay
      );

      gallery.addEventListener(
        "mouseleave",
        startAutoplay
      );

      gallery.addEventListener(
        "focusin",
        stopAutoplay
      );

      gallery.addEventListener(
        "focusout",
        startAutoplay
      );

      window.addEventListener(
        "resize",
        updateGallery
      );

      updateGallery();
      startAutoplay();
    });
</script>

<style>
  .lunixia-page {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 1rem 0 5rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns:
      minmax(0, 1.2fr)
      minmax(310px, 0.8fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: 3rem;
    min-height: 620px;
    padding: 4rem 0;
  }

  .hero-copy,
  .hero-showcase {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6.5rem);
    line-height: 0.96;
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
  }

  .eyebrow,
  .card-kicker,
  .mini-label {
    margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .hero-text,
  .intro-section p,
  .spotlight p,
  .community-banner p,
  .cta-section > p {
    max-width: 760px;
    font-size: 1.06rem;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .primary-button,
  .secondary-button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 50px;
    padding: 0.9rem 1.3rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 999px;
    color: var(--color-bg);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition:
      transform 0.2s ease,
      border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .primary-button {
    background: var(--accent-periwinkle);
  }

  .secondary-button {
    background: var(--surface-raised) !important;
    color: var(--color-text) !important;
  }

  .primary-button:hover,
  .secondary-button:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    border-color: var(--accent-periwinkle);
  }

  .hero-showcase {
    min-height: 410px;
  }

  .showcase-card,
  .floating-card,
  .feature-card,
  .share-demo,
  .details-list details,
  .community-banner,
  .cta-card {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: var(--surface-standard);
    box-shadow: var(--glass-shadow-soft);
  }

  .main-card {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 55px 20px 55px 30px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 30px;
    transform: rotate(2deg);
  }

  .main-card h4 {
    max-width: 420px;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.6rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
  }

  .progress-line {
    height: 10px;
    margin: 1.75rem 0;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--surface-raised);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .progress-line span {
    display: block;
    width: 72%;
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: inherit;
    background: var(--accent-periwinkle);
    animation: pulse-width 3s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .showcase-stats {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .showcase-stats b {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .floating-card {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 3;
    padding: 1rem 1.15rem;
    border-radius: 18px;
    animation: float 5s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .floating-card span {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .floating-card strong {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }

  .floating-card-one {
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
  }

  .floating-card-two {
    bottom: 8px;
    left: 0;
    animation-delay: -2.4s;
  }

  @media (min-width: 901px) {
    :global(.content:has(.lunixia-page)) {
      max-width: 1280px;
      padding-inline: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 3rem);
